WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:04.127
New in Keating 4.0: GPT Live.

00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:08.407
Pick it in the voice model picker — and just talk.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:12.967
Wait — can we make the eigenvector idea visible?

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.340
Picture a transformation stretching one line, while its direction stays fixed.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:26.447
Your recent messages and course context come with you, so the call picks up where the chat left off.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.800
Every session shows a spending ceiling.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.400
Ending the call stops the microphone at once.

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.507
Need to share an image?

00:00:34.707 --> 00:00:38.167
The other live providers are one pick away.

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:41.387
Talk it through — then get back to the page.
